<title>USA: Medical Technology names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Medical Technology names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Technology &amp; Innovations Inc said Tuesday it has named Robert Brennan president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Jeremy Feakins, who remains chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Previously, Brennan was vice president and general manager of Dentsply International Inc's Trubyte division.</p>
<p>&quot;As chief operating officer, he will free me from day-to-day duties so that I may focus my energies where they really belong: growing the comapny through strategic marketing of our unique patented products,&quot; Feakins said in a statement.</p>
</text>
